                        "name": "Patrick Williams",
                        "email": "patrick@stwcx.xyz",
                        "username": "williamspatrick"
                    },
                    "message": "All commits need a title line.  It should be one succinct line, under ~70-80 characters.\n\nYou don't need to reference file names in a commit title.\n\nIt's best to say what we're fixing and why it was wrong or why this is right in the body of the commit message.  Commit messages without a body should be rare.\n\nThe body shouldn't say [just] _what_ we are doing but more importantly _why_."
                },
